repository-code: "https://github.com/bakathefish/redress"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - JWST
  - Little Red Dots
  - photometric selection
  - positive-unlabeled learning
abstract: "Seven published photometric selections of Little Red Dots re-implemented as tested code, a positive-unlabeled gradient-boosted ranker trained on catalog quantities and evaluated with whole sky regions held out, the released weights, the out-of-fold evaluation tables and a ranked catalog of candidates not matched to any input list at the catalog freeze."
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: "How complete are photometric selections of Little Red Dots? Seven published criteria and a learned selection tested against 151 spectroscopic LRDs"
